hange with Earth through contracts, where your decisions have the power to shape their political landscape. Choose a faction to support or navigate the field strategically for maximum profit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble a team of colonists</h2> People are your most valuable resource. Keep track of your colonists' health, mood and needs. Hire the best experts and make sure they work as a team: it\u2019s their unique traits and skills that will allow you to truly optimize your production and research!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465470/extras/1c9fabe9f51224e501e5dcb5b244990e.poster.avif?t=1770909971\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465470/extras/1c9fabe9f51224e501e5dcb5b244990e.webm?t=1770909971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465470/extras/1c9fabe9f51224e501e5dcb5b244990e.mp4?t=1770909971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build a lunar colony<br></li><li>Mine and automate resources and production<br></li><li>Explore the moon<br></li><li>Play through a rich, story driven narrative <br></li><li>Trade with Earth<br></li><li>Influence politics<br></li><li>Manage colonists and their needs</li></ul>","developers":["VEOM Studio"],"dlc":[2293920],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1465470/0b52b754b8ee306f3b5d8c79f4a7a7b6c289b974/header_alt_assets_14.jpg?t=1770909971","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><